ority/data-theme/ENVI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/NON_PUBLIC"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Helsingbotica project aims to contribute to the development of the infrastructure for the vehicles of the future by developing capabilities for data sharing between micromobility and the city.  This specific dataset or catalog is to share the policy for delivery robots developed by the city and to implemented by the provider in this case \"Hugo\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Helsingbotica-projektet syftar till att bidra till utvecklingen av infrastrukturen för framtidens fordon genom att utveckla möjligheter för datadelning mellan mikromobilitet och stad. Denna specifika datamängd eller katalog ska dela policyn för leveransrobotar som utvecklats av staden och som implementeras av leverantören i detta fall \"Hugo\"."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2023-11-02T09:00:00.000Z"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://datakatalog.helsingborg.se/store/3/resource/489"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2706766"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HelsingBotica - MDS standard - Policy - Delivery robot"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"HelsingBotica - MDS-standard - Policy - Leveransrobot"}]},{"@id":"https://datakatalog.helsingborg.se/store/3/resource/495","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Helsingbotica-RequirementMetadata.txt"},{"@id":"https://datakatalog.helsingborg.se/store/3/resource/496","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://datakatalog.helsingborg.se/store/3/resource/495"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://datakatalog.helsingborg.se/store/3/resource/495"},"dct:description":{"@language":"en","@value":"Contains metadata applicable to the agency and  information about an agency's pro